{#
The answer to a pin or an unpin (#654): the row redrawn where it stands, with
its thumbtack and data-pinned changed. Moving it into or out of the pinned
group is assets/pin.js's, which keeps the rest of the list still while it does.

Accepts `thread` or `message`, as the star's stream does.
#}
<turbo-stream action="replace" target="thread_{{ message is defined ? message.id : thread.id }}">
    <template>
        {% include '_partials/_thread_row.html.twig' %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
